{
  "$comment": "Order 40's per-driver subject manifest. A driver listed here must be re-run at a PR's head when any of its subjects changes, and the sweep-main command runs every entry's `sweep` block against current origin/main. A new driver adds its own block additively. `sweep.argv` may carry {checkout}, {shortSha}, {statusUrl} and {artifactOut}, filled after the isolated checkout exists.",
